      SYSTEM   : Diamond_8k_compact

      System Properties:
      NGVEC    : 1999           #### sum of Q_sizes.npy, printed by compress_H2_compact.py
      NEUP     : 4              #### electrons per k-point and spin
      EBANDS   : 0
      NEDOWN   : 4
      NORB     : 8              #### orbitals per k-point
      EHZB     : 0
      ECONST   : 0
      SPIN     : 0
      FSG      : 0.0            #### singularity exported by VASP (afqmc.yaml); 0 for the 2x2x2 diamond export
      KPOINT   : 8

      CONTROL PARAMETER FOR THIS RUN:
      PROPAG   : S2
      EQLB     : 0.2
      DTAU     : 0.00025        #### eV^-1
      NWAK     : 256
      NSTP     : 4000
      BLKDIV   : 15
      TMAX     : 184800
      OTEY     : 6
      TIMG     : 10
      TREL     : 10
      SEED     : 12345

      DATA FILES (compact H2: (nb*nk, nb, ng_total)):
      H1FILE   : H1_svd.npy
      H2FILE   : H2_zip.npy     #### compact, from compress_H2_compact.py (a dense (nb*nk, nb*nk, ng) file is also accepted)
      QLIST    : Q_list.npy     #### rows [K1, K2, Q], one-based; must conserve momentum for compact H2
      QSIZES   : Q_sizes.npy    #### columns of every q sector (default: equal split)

      METHOD IMPLEMENTATION:
      UPDTM    : H
      REOPRI   : 1
      REORTHO  : QR      #### QR or Cholesky (Cholesky requires JAX backend)
      REBPRI   : 10
      REBMTH   : global  #### local or global
      SMFRQ    : 1
      CHPRI    : 99999

      SINGULAR VALUE DECOMPOSITION and HATREE-FOCK:
      SVD      : False
      SVDT     : 1e-7
      HF       : False
      HFTAU    : 1.0e-10
      HFSTP    : 1

      Config:
      PRECSION : Double
      BACKEND  : NumPy
